# Local operator runbooks — deliberately untracked. They contain the step-by-step
# GCP console/CLI setup that only the person holding those consoles needs.
# Nothing tracked points at them by path: comments that used to cite a section
# number now carry the fact itself instead, so a checkout without these files
# reads as complete rather than as one missing a document it keeps citing.
#
# The alert policies in deploy/monitoring/ are NOT covered by this: they are
# declarative resources applied from the repo, not instructions for a human, and
# they carry no project-specific identifiers.
deploy/observability.md
deploy/messaging.md
deploy/runbooks/
deployment.md
development.md

# Local state written by `langgraph dev` (Studio). Regenerated per run.
backend/.langgraph_api/
